  "details": "It's a small QoL improvement, but the other chat-game I play (Rec Room) does this out of the box. I'd just like to see the ability to press the grip once to pick something up, then have it stay \"in the hand\" until the grip is pressed again. It'll make it far easier when playing games where I have to hold the grip to keep an item/weapon/etc in my hand.\nIt could even be a toggle in the settings menu. Just an idea! :-)",
